# Files under /img and /cover keep the old site's URLs, with no content hash in their names, so they get a day of caching
# plus a week of stale-while-revalidate instead of the immutable rule the build adds for /_astro/*. A replaced image
# can show its old version for up to a day. Never add a rule that matches /_astro/*: the build then skips its own.
/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/cover/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
